#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:806
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Seo é airde an ghlao do gach aschur. Cuirtear an leibhéal i bhfeidhm go "
"huathoibríoch nuair a nasctar glao agus aon uair a athraíonn an t-aschur le "
"linn glao, agus cloistear athruithe an tsleamhnáin láithreach. Cuireann na "
"crua-earraí na leibhéil i bhfeidhm i gcéimeanna garbha, agus ní thiteann an "
"cluasán ina thost go hiomlán riamh. Stóráiltear leibhéal Bluetooth le "
"haghaidh tacaíocht ródúcháin atá le teacht."

